Now I am tired.
I put my book on the table.
I go out to the bathroom.
Here I get ready for the night.
I take my toothbrush.
I brush my teeth.
Afterwards I wash my face.
I dry myself with a towel.
I go into the bedroom.
I put on pyjamas.
Then I turn off the light.
Now the apartment is completely dark.
I lie down in my bed.
The bed is warm and soft.
I pull the duvet over me.
I close my eyes.
I am ready for a new day.
I sleep well.
